    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      234.43,
      302.03,
      355.86,
      310.89
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      321.83,
      451.2,
      360.33
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 4 of the Youthful Offenders (Training Schools)Ordinance (Chapter 25) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and thelegal effect of the section as amended is to make the provisions of the Ordinance genderneutral.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,BoldItalic",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      371.27,
      451.22,
      390.09
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 5 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to make the provisions of the Ordinance gender neutral.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,BoldItalic",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      401.03,
      451.2,
      439.53
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause amends section 16 of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to redefine the expression \u201cyouthful person\u201d as aperson who has attained the age of eighteen years and who has not attained the age oftwenty two years.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,BoldItalic",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      203.85,
      166.97,
      402.89,
      190.31
    ],
    "text": "1Youthful Offenders (Training Schools)(Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
