    "bbox": [
      198.57,
      227.69,
      365.01,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE YOUTHFUL OFFENDERS(TRAINING SCHOOLS) ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 25)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.9,
      288.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      301.49,
      401.89,
      349.79
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Youthful Offenders(Training Schools) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021 andshall come into operation on such date as the Minister mayby Order published in the Gazette appoint.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      363.05,
      401.87,
      423.59
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 4 of the Youthful Offenders (Training Schools)Ordinance (Chapter 25) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1)thereof, by the substitution for the words \u201cany male person-\u201d,of the words \u201cany person-\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      436.85,
      401.88,
      472.79
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 5 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201ca male person\u201d, of the words \u201ca person\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      486.05,
      401.88,
      534.23
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 16 of the principal enactment is herebyamended, by the repeal of the definition of the expression\u201cyouthful person\u201d and substitution therefor of the followingdefinition:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      188.85,
      547.49,
      401.87,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "\u201c\u201cyouthful person\u201d means a person who has attainedthe age of eighteen years and who has not attainedthe age of twenty two years; and \u201cyouthfuloffender\u201d has a corresponding meaning.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      609.65,
      401.89,
      633.71
    ],
    "text": "5.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
